This package repackages Broadcom's perccli64 binary (Dell PERC CLI utility,
version 007.1623.0000.0000 / Dell A11), redistributed as-is under Broadcom's
original license terms. Original source: Dell support downloads (driverid
52r3d), maintainer bangalore-mr-osutils.pdl@broadcom.com.

